### Third-Party Acknowledgements and Credits

This project relies on and was evaluated using the following third-party datasets and software frameworks. We give full credit to their respective creators:

**1. SAHI (Slicing Aided Hyper Inference)**
The slicing inference capabilities utilize the SAHI framework, which is licensed under the MIT License (Copyright (c) 2021 OBSS).
Citation:
> Akyon, F. C., Altinuc, S. O., & Temizel, A. (2022). Slicing Aided Hyper Inference and Fine-tuning for Small Object Detection. *2022 IEEE International Conference on Image Processing (ICIP)*, 966-970. doi: 10.1109/ICIP46576.2022.9897990.
Repository: https://github.com/obss/sahi

**2. WiSARD Dataset**
The thermal image datasets used for training and evaluating models in this repository are derived from the Wilderness Search and Rescue Dataset (WiSARD). 
Citation:
> Broyles, D., Hayner, C. R., & Leung, K. (2022). WiSARD: A Labeled Visual and Thermal Image Dataset for Wilderness Search and Rescue. *2022 IEEE/RSJ International Conference on Intelligent Robots and Systems (IROS)*, 9467–9474.
